cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the original HipSTR paper and this fork."
type: software
title: HipSTR-MT
abstract: >-
  A performance fork of HipSTR that adds thread-level parallelization, memory
  and vectorization optimizations, and an upgraded vendored htslib, while
  producing genotype-identical output to upstream HipSTR at any thread count.
version: 0.6.8
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22650334
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22650334
    description: Concept DOI, always resolving to the latest version
  # Zenodo mints the version-specific DOI when it archives the release, so it
  # is added after the fact: the tagged tree that produces the archive cannot
  # contain it.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22681705
    description: DOI of version 0.6.8
date-released: "2026-09-09"
